  "outlook": "Outlook for the Third Quarter Fiscal 2026: The Company expects net sales to be approximately $454.0 million to $462.0 million in the third quarter of fiscal 2026, compared to $394.4 million in the prior year, for a growth rate of 15.1% to 17.1%. Organically (excluding net sales from VACCO) net sales are expected to grow 7.4% to 9.5%. Adjusted gross margin is expected to be in the range of 44.0% to 44.25% and SG&A as a percentage of net sales is expected to be in the range of 17.0% to 17.25%."
